Methodology
-----------
The council review follows Andrej Karpathy's "LLM Council" approach (independent advisors,
anonymous peer review, chairman synthesis).

The methodology notes in aladeen/knowledge/ are original summaries and adaptations, for the
Indian market, of frameworks described in:
  - Aswath Damodaran, Investment Valuation (2nd ed.)
  - Benjamin Graham, The Intelligent Investor (revised ed.)
  - Benjamin Graham and David Dodd, Security Analysis (6th ed.)

Data
----
The software fetches data at run time from third-party websites (Screener.in, Yahoo Finance,
BSE, Google News). No third-party data is redistributed in this repository except small test
fixtures captured from public pages for parser tests (tests/fixtures/). Users are responsible
for complying with each data source's terms of use.
